      "lines": [
        "39. 把分数化成新分母的分数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分数$\\frac{3}{4}$的分子和分母同乘以2，得",
        "$\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{6}{8}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把分数$\\frac{3}{4}$换成与它相等、并且分母为8的分数$\\frac{6}{8}$. 这",
        "就说，我们把分数$\\frac{3}{4}$的分母化成了8. 任何一个分数的分母",
        "都可以化成为它的倍数的新分母. 例如，我们把分数$\\frac{7}{12}$的分",
        "母化成48. 48是12的倍数，因为$48\\div12=4$. 因此分数$\\frac{7}{12}$",
        "的分子和分母应该乘以4."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "得：$\\frac{7}{12}=\\frac{7\\cdot4}{12\\cdot4}=\\frac{28}{48}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4叫做补因数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "再看一个例子. 把分数$\\frac{4}{5}$的分母化成30. 我们先求出",
        "分数$\\frac{4}{5}$的分母的补因数，因为$30\\div5=6$，所以补因数等于6.",
        "分数的分子和分母乘以6，得：$\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{24}{30}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "705",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "705. 把下列分数的分母化成箭头所指的数：",
        "1) $\\frac{7}{6}\\longrightarrow18$；　　3) $\\frac{14}{13}\\longrightarrow78$；"
      ]
    },
